{
  "name": "douyin-realtime-hot-rises",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "抖音上升热点选题助手用于回答「拍什么会有流量」、找上升选题、看赛道是否升温、辅助内容策划会，适合内容创作者、运营、电商、营销在明确业务目标、内容材料或分析对象后调用。 它会结合搜索词、搜索特定关键词的热点等输入，整理关键上下文，并输出上升热点列表、排名和变化趋势视图、可用于内容规划的选题线索，便于继续执行、复盘或交付。",
  "keywords": [
    "douyin",
    "search",
    "hot",
    "keyword",
    "content-analysis",
    "competitor-analysis"
  ],
  "author": "um-why",
  "license": "MIT",
  "type": "commonjs",
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=16.14.0"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "search": "node src/douyin/search-cli.js",
    "post": "node src/douyin/post-cli.js",
    "comment": "node src/douyin/comment-cli.js",
    "hot": "node src/douyin/hot-cli.js"
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/um-why/douyin-search-openclaw.git"
  }
}